or: [object Object]\"\u003eSnapdragon® 680 Mobile Platform\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Times New Roman\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- 6nm Process Technology\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Times New Roman\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- CPU: 8 cores, up to 2.4GHz\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Times New Roman\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eGPU: Qualcomm® AdrenoTM\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Times New Roman\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eLPDDR4X + eMMC 5.1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: 